note right of UC072
  **Stock Search:**
  
  Search by:
  - Symbol (VCB, FPT, AAPL)
  - Company name
  
  Results show:
  - Symbol
  - Full name
  - Market/Exchange
  - Current price (if available)
  
  Support: 30+ VN + 6 US stocks
end note

note right of UC082
  **Pattern Categories:**
  
  Tabs:
  1. Candle Patterns (49)
     - Single (11)
     - Two Candle (15)
     - Three Candle (18)
     - Multi Candle (5)
  
  2. Chart Patterns (12)
     - Triangles (3)
     - H&S (2)
     - Tops/Bottoms (2)
     - Others (5)
  
  3. Technical Indicators
     (Placeholder for future)
end note

note right of UC092
  **Pattern Markers:**
  
  Visual Elements:
  - Triangle up (▲): Bullish
  - Triangle down (▼): Bearish
  - Size: 8-12px
  - Position: Below/Above candle
  
  Colors:
  - Green (#26a69a): Bullish
  - Red (#ef5350): Bearish
  - Yellow (#ffd54f): Neutral
  
  Z-index: 10 (above candles)
end note

note right of UC101
  **Zoom Controls:**
  
  Mouse wheel:
  - Up: Zoom in
  - Down: Zoom out
  
  Touch:
  - Pinch: Zoom in/out
  - Two-finger pan: Navigate
  
  Keyboard:
  - +/-: Zoom
  - Arrow keys: Pan
  - Home: Reset
end note

note bottom of UC111
  **Time Range Presets:**
  
  - 1M: Last 30 days
  - 3M: Last 90 days
  - 6M: Last 180 days
  - 1Y: Last 365 days
  - ALL: Full history
  - CUSTOM: Date picker
  
  Data retention:
  - VN stocks: Up to 10 years
  - US stocks: Up to 10 years
end note

note bottom of UC121
  **Theme Configuration:**
  
  Dark Mode:
  - Background: #1E1E1E
  - Grid: #2B2B2B
  - Text: #D1D4DC
  - Up candle: #26a69a
  - Down candle: #ef5350
  
  Light Mode:
  - Background: #FFFFFF
  - Grid: #E0E0E0
  - Text: #333333
  - Up candle: #089981
  - Down candle: #f23645
end note

note bottom of UC142
